WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.448
With a holy light, Allah told Grandpa Zakariyya, You will have a son named Yahya.

2
00:00:05.848 --> 00:00:11.056
Little Yahya was born! His parents held him gently, their hearts full of gratitude.

3
00:00:11.456 --> 00:00:17.744
From childhood, Yahya loved learning. Every day he sat in the temple, reading the scripture with care.

4
00:00:18.144 --> 00:00:23.064
He was also a devoted child, often bringing water for his elderly parents to drink.

5
00:00:23.464 --> 00:00:29.296
When he grew up, Yahya called the people, Worship only the One Allah, and do many good deeds.

6
00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:35.168
Many listened to him. The village became peaceful and harmonious, and everyone helped one another.

7
00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:43.920
Allah said, Yahya, hold firmly to the scripture. Children, you too should love learning, honor your parents, and hold on to kindness!
